---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import { img } from '../lib/site-images';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Mission, history, and strategic objectives of Artify Ocala — nonprofit arts organization in Marion County, Florida."
>
  <Section>
    <h1 class="type-display-xl">About Artify Ocala</h1>
    <p class="type-lede">
      Learn who we are, why we exist, and how we serve artists and neighbors across Marion County.
    </p>
    <figure class="mt-xl max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line">
      <img
        src={img.aboutGraphic}
        alt=""
        width={748}
        height={880}
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="block w-full"
      />
    </figure>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="dark">
    <div class="mb-lg max-w-xl">
      <img
        src={img.communityFeatured}
        alt="Community arts programming in Marion County"
        width={1317}
        height={1756}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/[0.12]"
      />
    </div>
    <h2 class="type-display-lg">Who we are</h2>
    <div
      class="prose-inner max-w-[48rem] [&_p]:mb-md [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_a]:font-medium [&_a]:text-accent-soft [&_a]:no-underline hover:[&_a]:underline"
    >
      <p>
        Since 2017 Artify Ocala (formerly known as <strong>Art Army Ocala</strong>) has served the greater
        Marion County community in collaboration with a growing number of visual artists and performing
        artists from a variety of disciplines. By partnering with local organizations and agencies, we
        have organized multiple events that create opportunities for local artists and broaden their
        reach. We empower artists by connecting them to opportunities to showcase their work and integrate
        their artistry into the lives of fellow community members.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <h2 class="type-display-lg">Our mission</h2>
    <blockquote
      class="m-0 rounded-r-lg border-l-4 border-accent bg-accent/[0.08] p-lg text-[1.1rem] italic leading-relaxed"
    >
      At Artify Ocala, our mission is to cultivate a vibrant arts community in Marion County by empowering
      local artists and performers through collaboration, opportunity, and creative expression. We are
      dedicated to enhancing community engagement by providing diverse platforms for artistic showcase,
      education, and interactive experiences. Through initiatives like Brick City Glam and Storytelling
      Knights, we aim to inspire creativity, foster connections, and enrich the cultural landscape of our
      community, ensuring that art is accessible and integral to the lives of all residents.
    </blockquote>

    <h3 class="mt-xl font-display text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Strategic objectives
    </h3>
    <ul class="mb-lg flex max-w-[44rem] list-none flex-col gap-md p-0">
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Empower local artists:</strong> Facilitate professional development and paid performance
        opportunities to enhance visibility and sustainability.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Enhance community engagement:</strong> Organize inclusive events that connect artists
        with community members.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Promote diversity in the arts:</strong> Celebrate many artistic disciplines and cultural
        expressions, ensuring representation from all voices.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Expand educational initiatives:</strong> Offer workshops and mentorship that nurture
        creativity across age groups.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Create collaborative spaces:</strong> Partner with local organizations for venues and
        resources that encourage cross-disciplinary collaboration.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-md">
        <strong>Encourage inclusive storytelling:</strong> Use platforms like Storytelling Knights to make
        creative storytelling accessible and community-building.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="type-muted max-w-[40rem]">
      By pursuing these objectives, Artify Ocala aims to be a cornerstone of artistic innovation and
      community connection, making art a vital part of everyday life in Marion County.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-lg flex flex-wrap gap-sm">
      <Button href="/programs/brick-city-glam" tone="outline">Brick City Glam</Button>
      <Button href="/programs/storytelling-knights" tone="ghost">Storytelling Knights</Button>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
